8. Use of systemic immunosuppressants within 6 weeks prior to screening;
9. Patients with a history of invasive malignancies (except non-melanoma skin cancer), unless treated with curative intent and with no clinical signs or symptoms of the malignancy for 5 years;
10. Patients who are participating or have participated in other clinical studies within the 30 days before the study enrolment.
11. Women who are pregnant or breast-feeding or who wish to become pregnant during the period of the clinical investigation and for three months later.

